1
00:00:09,926 --> 00:00:11,596
(Sheldon:)Hello.

2
00:00:11,803 --> 00:00:13,343
(Sheldon:)I'm Dr. Sheldon Cooper...

3
00:00:13,513 --> 00:00:16,683
(Sheldon:)...and welcome to the premiere episode
of Sheldon Cooper Presents:

4
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:19,020
(Sheldon:)Fun with Flags.

5
00:00:20,145 --> 00:00:21,685
(Sheldon:)Over the next 52 weeks...

6
00:00:21,855 --> 00:00:27,025
(Sheldon:)...you and I are going to explore
the dynamic world of vexillology.

7
00:00:27,193 --> 00:00:31,323
(Amy:)Hang on, Dr. C. What's vexillology?

8
00:00:32,949 --> 00:00:36,329
(Sheldon:)Vexillology is the study of flags.

9
00:00:36,494 --> 00:00:38,244
(Amy:)Cool.

10
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:41,710
(Amy:)I think I just learned something.

11
00:00:42,042 --> 00:00:45,082
- Did you have fun doing it?
- I'll say.

12
00:00:46,254 --> 00:00:50,054
(Sheldon:)Fun and information
are two sides to this video podcast.

13
00:00:50,216 --> 00:00:54,676
Not unlike the only two-sided state flag:
Oregon.

14
00:00:55,805 --> 00:00:57,475
(Sheldon:)Oh, look.

15
00:00:57,682 --> 00:00:59,932
(Sheldon:)Hello, Mr. Beaver.

16
00:01:00,852 --> 00:01:04,482
(Sheldon:)In future episodes,
we'll answer some burning questions.

